Test 5 — Rate limiting
for i in {1..30}; do
  curl -s -o /dev/null -w "Request $i: %{http_code}\n" \
    -X POST "$AI_GATEWAY_URL" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{
      "model": "'"$MODEL"'",
      "messages": [
        {"role": "user", "content": "Hello"}
      ]
    }'
done


Expected: HTTP 429 after exceeding the configured rate limit, assuming the threshold is below the number of requests in the applicable window.
